Q: What is Linq To SQL?
A: Linq To SQL is an ORM* framework that can automatically create .NET classes based on database tables. Then we can use Linq To SQL queries such as "select", "delete",
"update" and so forth, in any .NET supported languages like C#.
There is something named Linq To SQL provider which converts the queries to an understandable expression for a database.
It is considerable that Linq supports only SQL server databases.

*ORM (Object Relational Mapping): is a technique for converting data between database and programming language. 
